        "description": {
          "en-US": "StreamVault is a universal streaming media player for Fire TV and Android.\nOrganise and play live channels (ITV), Plex libraries, IP cameras (iCam),\nlocal files, network shares, and HDHomeRun tuners in one app.\nFull EPG guide, Live Sports with ESPN scoreboard integration, DVR recording,\ntimeshift, and complete D-pad navigation for remote control.\nNo accounts. No tracking."
